 cache←Rehydrate cache
⍝ Hash the search index and define the lookup function of a cache namespace so it is ready for query functions.
⍝ cache: cache namespace, updated in place :: namespace ref
 cache.videos.(index←1500⌶index)       ⍝ Prime index for hashing
 cache.videos.(Lookup←index∘⍳)         ⍝ Create index function
 :If 0<≢cache.videos.index
     {}cache.videos.(Lookup 1⌷index)   ⍝ First use of lookup function causes hash to build
 :EndIf
